      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_NOA_KNIGHT_RED",
      "UnitNameString": [
        "SI_NPC_TOWNGUARD"
      ],
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "퇴치를 도와주시겠다고요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "退治をお手伝いくださるのですか？",
